{"title":"四大神器:SSH，Netcat，Tmux，Vim","uid":"83d3c34f6b39d9ed01dfd29ebf47b548","slug":"四大神器-SSH，Netcat，Tmux，Vim","date":"2026-04-21T14:06:43.000Z","updated":"2026-04-21T14:06:43.000Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/四大神器-SSH，Netcat，Tmux，Vim.json","keywords":null,"cover":"https://img.090227.xyz/file/ae62475a131f3734a201c.png","content":"<h1 id=\"🛠️-四大神器：SSH、Netcat、Tmux、Vim\"><a href=\"#🛠️-四大神器：SSH、Netcat、Tmux、Vim\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"🛠️ 四大神器：SSH、Netcat、Tmux、Vim\"></a>🛠️ 四大神器：SSH、Netcat、Tmux、Vim</h1><hr>\n<h2 id=\"📡-一、SSH-Secure-Shell\"><a href=\"#📡-一、SSH-Secure-Shell\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"📡 一、SSH (Secure Shell)\"></a>📡 一、SSH (Secure Shell)</h2><blockquote><span class=\"custom-blockquote-svg\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-reactroot=\"\">\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M22 12C22 6.5 17.5 2 12 2C6.5 2 2 6.5 2 12C2 17.5 6.5 22 12 22C13.8 22 15.5 21.5 17 20.6L22 22L20.7 17C21.5 15.5 22 13.8 22 12Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M17 8.5C15.23 8.97 14.07 10.84 14.01 13.27C14 13.33 14 13.4 14 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M9 8.5C7.23 8.97 6.07 10.84 6.01 13.27C6 13.33 6 13.4 6 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n</svg>\n</span><p><em>在不安全网络上提供加密的远程登录、命令执行与文件传输的安全协议。</em></p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"基础信息\"><a href=\"#基础信息\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"基础信息\"></a>基础信息</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>默认端口</strong>：<code>22</code></li>\n<li><strong>核心功能</strong>：机密性、完整性、身份验证</li>\n<li><strong>主流实现</strong>：现代操作系统均原生支持 <strong>OpenSSH</strong> 客户端。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"高级用途\"><a href=\"#高级用途\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"高级用途\"></a>高级用途</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>跳板机 &#x2F; 跳转主机</strong>：用于枚举内网、传输工具、建立持久化通道。</li>\n<li><strong>稳定性对比</strong>：通常比反向 Shell 连接更稳定可靠。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"连接命令示例\"><a href=\"#连接命令示例\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"连接命令示例\"></a>连接命令示例</h3><figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 基本语法</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">ssh username@IP_Address</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 实际示例</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">ssh finis@192.168.110.110</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h2 id=\"💡-第三方-GUI-工具推荐\"><a href=\"#💡-第三方-GUI-工具推荐\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"💡 第三方 GUI 工具推荐\"></a>💡 第三方 GUI 工具推荐</h2><blockquote><span class=\"custom-blockquote-svg\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-reactroot=\"\">\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M22 12C22 6.5 17.5 2 12 2C6.5 2 2 6.5 2 12C2 17.5 6.5 22 12 22C13.8 22 15.5 21.5 17 20.6L22 22L20.7 17C21.5 15.5 22 13.8 22 12Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M17 8.5C15.23 8.97 14.07 10.84 14.01 13.27C14 13.33 14 13.4 14 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M9 8.5C7.23 8.97 6.07 10.84 6.01 13.27C6 13.33 6 13.4 6 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n</svg>\n</span><p>适合不习惯命令行的用户进行会话管理与文件传输：<br>PuTTY | Xshell | Termius | FinalShell | Tabby</p></blockquote>\n<h1 id=\"🗡️-二、Netcat-nc-ncat\"><a href=\"#🗡️-二、Netcat-nc-ncat\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"🗡️ 二、Netcat (nc &#x2F; ncat)\"></a>🗡️ 二、Netcat (nc &#x2F; ncat)</h1><blockquote><span class=\"custom-blockquote-svg\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-reactroot=\"\">\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M22 12C22 6.5 17.5 2 12 2C6.5 2 2 6.5 2 12C2 17.5 6.5 22 12 22C13.8 22 15.5 21.5 17 20.6L22 22L20.7 17C21.5 15.5 22 13.8 22 12Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M17 8.5C15.23 8.97 14.07 10.84 14.01 13.27C14 13.33 14 13.4 14 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M9 8.5C7.23 8.97 6.07 10.84 6.01 13.27C6 13.33 6 13.4 6 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n</svg>\n</span><p>被誉为网络界的“瑞士军刀”，用于 TCP&#x2F;UDP 端口交互、探测与数据传输。</p></blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"核心功能速览\"><a href=\"#核心功能速览\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"核心功能速览\"></a>核心功能速览</h2><p>功能场景\t命令示例\t说明</p>\n<ul>\n<li>监听端口 (服务端)\t<code>nc -l 8080</code>\t在本地 8080 端口开启监听</li>\n<li>连接服务 (客户端)\t<code>nc 192.168.110.100 8080</code>\t连接远程主机端口</li>\n<li>端口扫描\t<code>nc -v -z 192.168.110.110 20-80</code>\t扫描指定范围的开放端口</li>\n<li>文件传输\t接收端：<code>nc -l 8080 &gt; output.txt</code></li>\n<li>发送端：<code>nc 192.168.110.110 8080 &lt; input.txt</code>\t简易的数据收发管道<blockquote><span class=\"custom-blockquote-svg\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-reactroot=\"\">\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M22 12C22 6.5 17.5 2 12 2C6.5 2 2 6.5 2 12C2 17.5 6.5 22 12 22C13.8 22 15.5 21.5 17 20.6L22 22L20.7 17C21.5 15.5 22 13.8 22 12Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M17 8.5C15.23 8.97 14.07 10.84 14.01 13.27C14 13.33 14 13.4 14 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M9 8.5C7.23 8.97 6.07 10.84 6.01 13.27C6 13.33 6 13.4 6 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n</svg>\n</span><p>⚠️ 版本差异提醒：OpenBSD 版本的 Netcat 支持 TLS 加密，而 GNU 版本功能略有不同。实际使用时建议先 man nc 确认支持参数。</p></blockquote>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h1 id=\"🖥️-三、Tmux-终端复用器\"><a href=\"#🖥️-三、Tmux-终端复用器\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"🖥️ 三、Tmux (终端复用器)\"></a>🖥️ 三、Tmux (终端复用器)</h1><blockquote><span class=\"custom-blockquote-svg\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-reactroot=\"\">\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M22 12C22 6.5 17.5 2 12 2C6.5 2 2 6.5 2 12C2 17.5 6.5 22 12 22C13.8 22 15.5 21.5 17 20.6L22 22L20.7 17C21.5 15.5 22 13.8 22 12Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M17 8.5C15.23 8.97 14.07 10.84 14.01 13.27C14 13.33 14 13.4 14 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M9 8.5C7.23 8.97 6.07 10.84 6.01 13.27C6 13.33 6 13.4 6 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n</svg>\n</span><p>解绑会话与终端窗口，实现后台持久化运行，让 SSH 断开不再中断任务。</p></blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"核心优势\"><a href=\"#核心优势\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"核心优势\"></a>核心优势</h2><ul>\n<li><p><strong>会话保活</strong>：网络断开、终端关闭后，服务端任务仍在运行，重连后完美恢复现场。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>分屏协作</strong>：支持在一个窗口内划分多个水平&#x2F;垂直窗格 (Pane)。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>结对编程</strong>：允许多个客户端同时连接同一个会话。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"⌨️-常用操作热键速记\"><a href=\"#⌨️-常用操作热键速记\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"⌨️ 常用操作热键速记\"></a>⌨️ 常用操作热键速记</h2><p>操作目的\t命令 &#x2F; 快捷键\t备注</p>\n<ul>\n<li>启动新会话\t<code>tmux 或 tmux new -s &lt;会话名&gt;</code>\t推荐命名以便区分</li>\n<li>分离会话 (后台运行)\t<code>Ctrl + b</code> 松开后按 <code>d</code>\t最常用保活操作</li>\n<li>接入已有会话\t<code>tmux attach -t &lt;会话名&gt;</code>\t恢复之前的界面</li>\n<li>列出所有会话\t<code>tmux ls</code>\t查看后台有哪些任务</li>\n<li>彻底杀死会话\t<code>tmux kill-session -t &lt;会话名&gt;</code>\t清理不再需要的会话</li>\n</ul>\n<h1 id=\"✍️-四、Vim-Vi-Improved\"><a href=\"#✍️-四、Vim-Vi-Improved\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"✍️ 四、Vim (Vi Improved)\"></a>✍️ 四、Vim (Vi Improved)</h1><blockquote><span class=\"custom-blockquote-svg\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-reactroot=\"\">\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M22 12C22 6.5 17.5 2 12 2C6.5 2 2 6.5 2 12C2 17.5 6.5 22 12 22C13.8 22 15.5 21.5 17 20.6L22 22L20.7 17C21.5 15.5 22 13.8 22 12Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M17 8.5C15.23 8.97 14.07 10.84 14.01 13.27C14 13.33 14 13.4 14 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M9 8.5C7.23 8.97 6.07 10.84 6.01 13.27C6 13.33 6 13.4 6 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n</svg>\n</span><p>基于键盘模态操作的高效文本编辑器，服务器运维与开发的标配工具。</p></blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"核心哲学\"><a href=\"#核心哲学\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"核心哲学\"></a>核心哲学</h2><p><strong>告别鼠标</strong>：一切操作通过键盘指令完成，速度极快。</p>\n<p><strong>模态编辑</strong>：明确区分浏览、编辑、命令三种状态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三大基础模式切换逻辑\"><a href=\"#三大基础模式切换逻辑\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"三大基础模式切换逻辑\"></a>三大基础模式切换逻辑</h2><ul>\n<li><p>普通模式 (Normal) ：启动后的默认状态，用于移动光标、复制粘贴、删除查找。按 i 进入插入模式。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>插入模式 (Insert) ：正常的文字输入状态。按 ESC 返回普通模式。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>底线命令模式：在普通模式下输入 : 进入，用于保存 (:w)、退出 (:q)、强制执行 (!) 或查找替换。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"进阶特性\"><a href=\"#进阶特性\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"进阶特性\"></a>进阶特性</h2><p><strong>语法高亮与智能缩进</strong></p>\n<p><strong>宏录制 (q 键) 实现批量重复操作</strong></p>\n<p><strong>高度可定制化 (.vimrc 配置文件)</strong></p>\n","feature":true,"text":"🛠️ 四大神器：SSH、Netcat、Tmux、Vim 📡 一、SSH (Secure Shell) 在不安全网络上提供加密的远程登录、命令执行与文件传输的安全协...","permalink":"/post/四大神器-SSH，Netcat，Tmux，Vim","photos":[],"count_time":{"symbolsCount":"1.5k","symbolsTime":"1 mins."},"categories":[{"name":"Tools","slug":"Tools","count":1,"path":"api/categories/Tools.json"}],"tags":[{"name":"Tools","slug":"Tools","count":1,"path":"api/tags/Tools.json"}],"toc":"<ol class=\"toc\"><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-1\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%F0%9F%9B%A0%EF%B8%8F-%E5%9B%9B%E5%A4%A7%E7%A5%9E%E5%99%A8%EF%BC%9ASSH%E3%80%81Netcat%E3%80%81Tmux%E3%80%81Vim\"><span class=\"toc-text\">🛠️ 四大神器：SSH、Netcat、Tmux、Vim</span></a><ol class=\"toc-child\"><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-2\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%F0%9F%93%A1-%E4%B8%80%E3%80%81SSH-Secure-Shell\"><span class=\"toc-text\">📡 一、SSH (Secure Shell)</span></a><ol class=\"toc-child\"><li class=\"toc-item toc-